                               -fr                 Filter regexp                
                               -fs                 Filter HTTP                  
                             response size. Comma separated list of             
                             sizes and ranges                                   
                               -ft                 Filter by number             
                             of milliseconds to the first response              
                             byte, either greater or less than. EG:             
                             >100 or <100                                       
                               -fw                 Filter by amount             
                             of words in response. Comma separated              
                             list of word counts and ranges                     
                                                                                
